---

This project is a port of MinUI (https://github.com/shauninman/MinUI) by shauninman.
Platform code is derived from the MinUI rgb30 platform implementation.

The GKD Pixel 2 firmware (kernel, device tree, ROCKNIX rootfs) is not included
and must be extracted from the user's own stock SD card.
ROCKNIX is licensed under GPL-2.0 (https://github.com/ROCKNIX/distribution).
